    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057940/extras/739481de0d9f2cdb3a54def38ed379ec.avif?t=1720555232\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><strong>Grow your collection of ultra rare ducks while you idle</strong> and click to earn more rare ducks!<br><table>    <tr>        <td><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057940/extras/b4c2f95678e70a47bea45cb8a4dbdf88.avif?t=1720555232\" width=200 height=200 /></span></td>        <td><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057940/extras/ed7e9e697f22b671a129298fed399a2d.avif?t=1720555232\" width=200 height=200 /></span></td>       <td><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057940/extras/752a7416c62bc8950378e3e84693576b.avif?t=1720555232\" width=200 height=200 /></span></td>    </tr></table><table>    <tr>        <td><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057940/extras/5d7d1b324c86dd4d61d605814a157167.avif?t=1720555232\" width=200 height=200 /></span></td>        <td><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057940/extras/2a700a8b93963c6306a6478253d4c60b.avif?t=1720555232\" width=200 height=200 /></span></td>       <td><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057940/extras/0e7f45e8cfc922d378393023c2fb1250.avif?t=1720555232\" width=200 height=200 /></span></td>    </tr></table>... and <strong>many </strong> more!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057940/extras/dc26b8efe3531d651034d112b2c274af.avif?t=1720555232\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Every duck you can earn has a limited time window that it can drop, meaning that future players won't be able to get them! <br><br>.. and if you're lucky enough, you might even get a duck with <strong>limited drop quantity</strong>, meaning you'll have one of very few ducks to exist!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057940/extras/1cce4476422eda0d37f2eeabdea8bd1a.avif?t=1720555232\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> View your ducks in-game<br></li><li> In-game drops<br></li><li> Community Discord<br></li><li> Cute duck quacks<br></li><li> Trade and sell your ducks<br></li><li> Combine ducks for a chance at getting a duck of a higher rarity (coming soon!)</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057940/extras/739481de0d9f2cdb3a54def38ed379ec.avif?t=1720555232\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><strong>Grow your collection of ultra rare ducks while you idle</strong> and click to earn more rare ducks!<br><table>    <tr>        <td><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057940/extras/b4c2f95678e70a47bea45cb8a4dbdf88.avif?t=1720555232\" width=200 height=200 /></span></td>        <td><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057940/extras/ed7e9e697f22b671a129298fed399a2d.avif?t=1720555232\" width=200 height=200 /></span></td>       <td><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057940/extras/752a7416c62bc8950378e3e84693576b.avif?t=1720555232\" width=200 height=200 /></span></td>    </tr></table><table>    <tr>        <td><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057940/extras/5d7d1b324c86dd4d61d605814a157167.avif?t=1720555232\" width=200 height=200 /></span></td>        <td><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057940/extras/2a700a8b93963c6306a6478253d4c60b.avif?t=1720555232\" width=200 height=200 /></span></td>       <td><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057940/extras/0e7f45e8cfc922d378393023c2fb1250.avif?t=1720555232\" width=200 height=200 /></span></td>    </tr></table>... and <strong>many </strong> more!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057940/extras/dc26b8efe3531d651034d112b2c274af.avif?t=1720555232\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br>Every duck you can earn has a limited time window that it can drop, meaning that future players won't be able to get them! <br><br>.. and if you're lucky enough, you might even get a duck with <strong>limited drop quantity</strong>, meaning you'll have one of very few ducks to exist!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3057940/extras/1cce4476422eda0d37f2eeabdea8bd1a.avif?t=1720555232\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> View your ducks in-game<br></li><li> In-game drops<br></li><li> Community Discord<br></li><li> Cute duck quacks<br></li><li> Trade and sell your ducks<br></li><li> Combine ducks for a chance at getting a duck of a higher rarity (coming soon!)</li></ul>",
